        "collapsible_tab_yGYd4C": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Key Features",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<ul><li>The Phoenix gravity system is a powerful and easy-to-set-up worktop filtration solution that requires no plumbing or electricity.</li><li>Crafted from high-grade AISI 304 stainless steel, the housing is naturally BPA-free and non-leaching.</li><li>Inside, premium silver-infused activated carbon filters made from CTC 60 coconut shells eliminate 99.9% of contaminants while preserving the essential minerals.</li><li>With a filtration capacity 20X better than a typical jug filters and GAC, Phoenix delivers cleaner, healthier water using the natural force of gravity offering a sustainable, long-lasting alternative built with eco-friendly materials.</li><li>Phoenix Gravity Smart Carbon Cartridges are precisely engineered for compatibility with almost all gravity-fed water systems, delivering consistent performance and clean, safe water you can rely on.</li></ul>",
            "c1": "",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_nFbX67": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Shipping and Returns",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<ul><li>Refunds are processed within 2 business days upon receiving and inspecting the returned product, and the amount will be credited to your original payment method within 7 business days.</li><li>A full refund is issued only if the complete product is returned; partial returns receive partial refunds.</li><li>Exchanges are available only for items with manufacturing defects or faults.</li><li>Return shipping is the customer’s responsibility and is non-refundable. For items over £99, we recommend using a trackable shipping service.</li></ul>",
            "c1": "",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_VyEEwT": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Compatibility",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Our Smart Carbon Cartridges are precision-designed to fit seamlessly with nearly all gravity-fed water filtration systems, including Berkey. Whether you’re replacing existing filters or setting up a new system, these cartridges deliver reliable performance and universal compatibility you can trust.<br/><br/>With Phoenix Gravity, you’re not just replacing a cartridge, you’re upgrading to smarter, cleaner, and more dependable water filtration.</p>",
